<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow">New practice onboarding</span>
    <h1>Getting started with <em>Kasper</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">Everything your front desk team needs to understand Kasper, navigate the patient journey, and get the most out of every feature — from the first phone call to final payment.</p>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <div class="meta-chip"><span class="meta-chip-dot"></span> Built exclusively for Open Dental</div>
      <div class="meta-chip"><span class="meta-chip-dot"></span> Front desk &amp; admin staff</div>
      <div class="meta-chip"><span class="meta-chip-dot"></span> No technical background required</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page-body">
  <main class="content-main">

    <!-- Section 1 -->
    <section class="section" id="section-intro">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-num">1</div>
        <h2>What is Kasper?</h2>
      </div>

      <p>Kasper is your practice's all-in-one platform, built specifically for offices running <strong>Open Dental</strong>. It replaces your phone system, reminders service, digital forms tool, payment processor, scheduling widget, and patient communication platform — consolidating everything into one place with a single login.</p>

      <p>The core idea is <strong>supervised practice management</strong>: Kasper doesn't just automate tasks, it actively watches every step of the patient journey and alerts your team when something needs attention — a missing form, an unpaid balance, a gap in the schedule, a call that didn't go as it should have.</p>

      <div class="callout purple">
        <span class="callout-icon">💡</span>
        <p><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Dental practices lose an average of <strong>9% of revenue</strong> to billing errors, missed follow-ups, and scheduling gaps. Kasper is designed to surface those issues while the patient is still in the building — before they become lost revenue.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card-icon">📞</div>
          <h3>Phone &amp; VoIP</h3>
          <p>Full phone system with caller ID screen pops, call recording, IVR, voicemail, and AI summaries auto-filed to each patient's chart.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card-icon">📋</div>
          <h3>Digital forms</h3>
          <p>Paperless intake, consent forms, and e-signatures via iPad or secure link — all synced to Open Dental instantly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card-icon">🔔</div>
          <h3>Reminders</h3>
          <p>Automated SMS and email reminders that reduce no-show rates by up to 35%. Confirmations update Open Dental automatically.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card-icon">💳</div>
          <h3>KasperPay</h3>
          <p>In-office terminals, manual card entry, saved cards, text-to-pay links, and payment plans — all posting to the Open Dental ledger in real time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card-icon">🛡️</div>
          <h3>Insurance verification</h3>
          <p>Automated real-time eligibility checks before every appointment. Benefits, deductibles, and coverage written directly to the patient's chart.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card-icon">📅</div>
          <h3>Online scheduling</h3>
          <p>Patients book 24/7. Syncs instantly with Open Dental — no double entry, no missed appointments, no phone tag.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card-icon">👁️</div>
          <h3>Intraday supervision</h3>
          <p>Live color-coded dashboard of every patient in the office with real-time flags, wait timers, and status tracking from arrival to checkout.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card-icon">📊</div>
          <h3>Revenue Leakage Protector</h3>
          <p>Surfaces uncollected balances, failed payments, unallocated funds, and unscheduled treatment before they quietly disappear.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card-icon">🔍</div>
          <h3>Opportunity Finder</h3>
          <p>When a cancellation opens a gap, instantly matches it to patients with planned treatment — ranked by insurance benefits and reliability.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 2 -->
    <section class="section" id="section-journey">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-num">2</div>
        <h2>The patient journey</h2>
      </div>

      <p>Kasper supports every touchpoint from the moment a new patient finds your practice online to the moment they've paid and received their follow-up. Here's what each step looks like from the front desk.</p>

      <div class="journey-line">
        <div class="journey-stop">
          <h3>Search &amp; book</h3>
          <p>Patients find your practice online and book through Kasper's scheduling widget — available on your website 24/7. The appointment lands directly in Open Dental. Kasper also sends automated review requests after visits to boost your Google visibility and bring in more new patients.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-stop">
          <h3>Forms sent automatically</h3>
          <p>As soon as an appointment is scheduled, Kasper automatically sends the patient their intake forms via text and email. They can complete them at home before arriving, speeding up check-in. If a patient misses a call and no one answers, Kasper fires an automatic SMS to let them know someone will follow up.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-stop">
          <h3>Automated reminders</h3>
          <p>Kasper sends customizable SMS and email appointment reminders on a schedule you control. When the patient confirms, Open Dental is updated automatically — no manual status change needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-stop">
          <h3>Insurance verification</h3>
          <p>Kasper checks insurance eligibility automatically before each appointment and writes the results to the patient's Open Dental chart. Your team sees coverage details, deductibles, and benefit limits before the patient walks in — no last-minute surprises at checkout.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-stop">
          <h3>Arrival &amp; check-in</h3>
          <p>The intraday dashboard shows every patient currently in the office as a color-coded card. At a glance: forms status, outstanding balance, hygiene due date, unscheduled treatment value, wait time, and time in office. Flags are color-coded — green means clear, red or yellow means act now.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-stop">
          <h3>Treatment plan &amp; consent</h3>
          <p>Providers can present treatment plans digitally and capture patient e-signatures on an iPad or via a secure link sent to the patient's phone. Signed consent syncs to the Open Dental chart automatically.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-stop">
          <h3>Payment at checkout</h3>
          <p>Collect payment via terminal (tap, chip, or swipe), manually entered card, saved card on file, or a text-to-pay link. KasperPay processes it securely and posts it to the Open Dental ledger in real time. There's also a Cash Discount option to pass the transaction fee to the patient or absorb it yourself.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-stop">
          <h3>Recall &amp; follow-up</h3>
          <p>After the visit, Kasper automatically sends hygiene recall reminders, "use it or lose it" insurance benefit messages as year-end approaches, post-op instructions, birthday greetings, and review requests — all on autopilot based on patient criteria and events.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="callout teal">
        <span class="callout-icon">✅</span>
        <p><strong>The key difference:</strong> Most software tells you what happened. Kasper tells you what needs to happen right now — and gives you a one-click path to handle it before the patient leaves.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 3 -->
    <section class="section" id="section-features">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-num">3</div>
        <h2>All features at a glance</h2>
      </div>

      <p>Every Kasper feature connects directly to Open Dental. The table below covers the full platform — including tools exclusive to Kasper that you won't find anywhere else.</p>

